			"notes": "Updates AFK Filter for **Minecraft 26.1.2**.\n\nMinecraft 26.x ships unobfuscated and requires **Java 25**. This release ports the mod and its tab-list mixin to the official Mojang names and updates the Fabric/Loom toolchain. Keybind categories are now `KeyMapping.Category` objects (26.x change). No feature changes — press F6 or use `/afkfilter` to toggle.\n\n## Requirements\n- Minecraft 26.1.2\n- Java 25+\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.2+ and Fabric API"
